      "writtenOn": "2022-11-02T13:43:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry for the delay. As for handling specifying in files, filing a bug to handle later sounds fine.\n\nHowever, there\u0027s more complication in determining whether hwasan is actually specified (e.g. if `sanitize.never: true`, it takes precedence over the global enablement, as well as hwasan being arch/OS specific. You likely are best off calling [`IsSanitizerEnabled(Hwasan)`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/sanitize.go;l\u003d1520;drc\u003db45a2ea782074944f79fc388df20b06e01f265f7) rather than trying to handle all of the edge cases in this function.",
